('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101','10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002','Which annotation marks a class as a Spring Boot application entry point?','@SpringBootApplication combines configuration, auto-configuration and component scanning for a typical Spring Boot application.',1,true),
